  "question": {
    "text": "A disc with a flat small bottom beaker placed on it at a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;from its center is revolving about an axis passing through the center and perpendicular to its plane with an angular velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi></math>. The coefficient of static friction between the bottom of the beaker and the surface of the disc is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi></math>. The beaker will revolve with the disc if :"
  },
